      "parentCompany": null,
      "shortDescription": "TECHTOP is the electric-motor brand of Shanghai Top Motor Co., Ltd., a Chinese manufacturer headquartered in Shanghai. Its official portfolio spans IEC and NEMA motors in aluminium, cast-iron, rolled-steel and stainless-steel housings, permanent-magnet synchronous motors and application-specific motor designs.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Official company sources trace TECHTOP's motor-manufacturing activity to 1985 and identify Shanghai Top Motor Co., Ltd. as the manufacturer behind the brand. The company develops and manufactures industrial and commercial electric motors and operates manufacturing bases in Shanghai and Fujian, supported by an international network of regional companies.",
        "The published range includes three-phase and single-phase IEC and NEMA motors, permanent-magnet synchronous motors, multi-speed and brake motors, explosion-proof designs and customised specialty motors. Housing and application variants include aluminium, cast iron, rolled steel and stainless steel, with dedicated configurations for pumps, cooling towers, smoke extraction, crushers, HVAC equipment and other driven machinery. Ventrovia can review TECHTOP motor requirements from a model, nameplate or technical specification without implying an authorised distribution relationship."
