        "Testo's official product structure covers temperature, humidity, pressure, airflow, combustion and emissions, electrical measurements, thermal imaging, data loggers, transmitters and connected Smart Probes. Its measurement and monitoring solutions are used in HVAC and refrigeration work, food-quality control, building and industrial maintenance, environmental and indoor-air assessment, and regulated pharmaceutical processes. Ventrovia can process sourcing enquiries for Testo instruments and systems from a model number or measurement requirement."
