      "shortDescription": "TLV manufactures fluid-measurement and control equipment for steam, condensate, air and water systems. Its portfolio includes steam traps, condensate-recovery equipment, pressure and control valves, separators, flowmeters, sensors and packaged steam-system solutions.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "TLV CO., LTD. is a Japanese manufacturer founded in 1950, with its head office and factory in Kakogawa, Hyogo. Official company information defines its business around steam traps, condensate pumps, pressure-reducing valves and other fluid-measurement and control equipment, together with engineering and services for steam and power systems.",
        "The TLV product programme covers mechanical, thermodynamic and thermostatic steam traps; condensate and waste-heat recovery; pressure-reducing and control valves; vortex flowmeters; separators; filters; sensors; air vents; check valves and piping accessories. System products include vacuum steam heating, condensate recovery, steam compression and desuperheating solutions, while maintenance instruments support steam-trap and rotating-equipment inspection. Ventrovia can review TLV sourcing requests from a model, duty point or steam-system specification."
      ],
