      "statusModifier": "GROUP_BRAND",
      "shortDescription": "TREPKO develops processing, filling and packaging machinery, primarily for food production. Its systems cover filling and closing, aseptic packaging, form-fill-seal, forming and wrapping, butter and margarine processing, bulk packaging and end-of-line automation.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "TREPKO traces its origins to a machine shop founded in Denmark in 1947 and identifies Trepko A/S in Ballerup as the group's head office. The company supplies processing, filling and packaging machinery through manufacturing and service operations serving customers across multiple regions.",
        "The official portfolio includes in-line, rotary, carousel and semi-automatic filling and closing machines; aseptic cup fillers; bottle-filling equipment; thermoforming, filling and sealing systems; and forming and wrapping machines. TREPKO also documents butter and margarine processing equipment, bag-in-box and bulk-packaging lines, plus end-of-line equipment for case packing, tray erecting, shrink wrapping, conveying, pick-and-place handling and palletising. These systems are primarily intended for dairy, edible-fat, condiment and other food-processing applications."
